{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29802","headline":"故番禺侯以赃罪致不辜事觉母者他日过其门 · 李商隐","name":"故番禺侯以赃罪致不辜事觉母者他日过其门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮鸩非君命，兹身亦厚亡。\n江陵从种橘，交广合投香。\n不见千金子，空馀数仞墙。\n杀人须显戮，谁举汉三章。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}